<div class="container py-5" style="max-width: 900px;">
  <div class="card shadow-sm">
    <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
      <h1 class="h3 mb-0">Support</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body" style="max-height: 70vh; overflow-y: auto;">
      <p class="text-muted"><small>AMOS Labs Support Center</small></p>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you need help with your AMOS account or have questions about our platform, our support team is here to assist you.</p>

      <h3 class="h6 mt-3">Email Support</h3>
      <p>Reach us at <a href="mailto:support@amoslabs.com">support@amoslabs.com</a>. We aim to respond within 24 hours on business days.</p>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Common Topics</h2>

      <h3 class="h6 mt-3">Account & Billing</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Account setup and configuration</li>
        <li>Subscription and billing questions</li>
        <li>Account deletion requests</li>
        <li>Password reset and two-factor authentication</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="h6 mt-3">AI Agent & Workflows</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Getting started with AI conversations</li>
        <li>Workflow creation and management</li>
        <li>Tool and integration setup</li>
        <li>Content generation questions</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="h6 mt-3">Integrations</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Connecting third-party services (Stripe, HubSpot, Mailgun, etc.)</li>
        <li>API and webhook configuration</li>
        <li>Troubleshooting connection issues</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="h6 mt-3">Mobile App</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>iOS and Android app setup</li>
        <li>Voice assistant and microphone issues</li>
        <li>Push notification configuration</li>
        <li>Biometric login (Face ID / Touch ID)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Report a Bug</h2>
      <p>Found a bug? Please email us at <a href="mailto:support@amoslabs.com">support@amoslabs.com</a> with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>A description of the issue</li>
        <li>Steps to reproduce it</li>
        <li>Your device and browser/app version</li>
        <li>Screenshots if applicable</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Privacy & Data</h2>
      <p>For privacy-related inquiries or data requests, please contact <a href="mailto:privacy@amoslabs.com">privacy@amoslabs.com</a>. You can also review our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-footer text-center">
      <%= link_to "Back to Login", new_user_session_path, class: "btn btn-outline-secondary" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
